voice/char_117_myrrh/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:8/83/rr90bcrdk88mw6ya97qpls3w1cgcf9t.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_117_myrrh/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/imx8l1bxuodlcmjws2kglry91i5ndt3.mp3","text":"博士，新年好。我正在准备开春要种植的药草的种子。希望它们可以茁壮成长，也希望，今年不要用到它们......","alt":"voice/char_117_myrrh/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/06vobhwppy9xlspymb521p4ikmsd40m.mp3","text":"早、早上好，博士。","alt":"voice/char_117_myrrh/cn_042.mp3"}]}}